   "ts": "1794582120.000100",
   "channel_id": "C0SORLAUNCH",
   "user_id": "U0SOREMEKA",
   "text": "Thursday 19 Nov prep, first pass: CLM-07 geometry 4 x 8 x 16 = 512, matches RCP-CLM-3. UW-03 dedup report PASS. FNOL-11 goes to Ifeoma for the 2560 context. SUB-02 clean. Window comes to about 352 GPU-h by my sheet, comfortably inside what we usually run.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794583200.000101",
   "channel_id": "C0SORLAUNCH",
   "user_id": "U0SORRAVI",
   "text": "CLM-07 is the same geometry CLM-06 launched with, recipe unchanged. Fine by me.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794585900.000102",
   "channel_id": "C0SORLAUNCH",
   "user_id": "U0SORSAOIRSE",
   "text": "FNOL-11 dry run is in Datadog, 7.6 s an update. We need the longer context, adjuster notes run long since the new form.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794816600.000103",
   "channel_id": "C0SORLAUNCH",
   "user_id": "U0SORODILE",
   "text": "Desk: I've mailed the ask for Thursday. Note to me when it's done, please.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794818400.000104",
   "channel_id": "C0SORLAUNCH",
   "user_id": "U0SORHALVARD",
   "text": "I'm primary this week. Change tickets for Thursday can come to me.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1793878200.000105",
   "channel_id": "C0SORDATA",
   "user_id": "U0SORGRETA",
   "text": "uw-faq-paraphrase-v1 is up: 1,840 rewritten FAQ pairs for UW-03, to give it more phrasing variety. Card and shards are in the usual places.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794546600.000106",
   "channel_id": "C0SORDATA",
   "user_id": "U0SORTOBIAS",
   "text": "Dedup for UW-03 came back PASS on both training sources. Zero exact, zero near-dup.",
